{"page":212,"verses":[{"verse_key":"10:26","surah":10,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"۞ لِّلَّذِينَ أَحْسَنُوا۟ ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ وَزِيَادَةٌ ۖ وَلَا يَرْهَقُ وُجُوهَهُمْ قَتَرٌ وَلَا ذِلَّةٌ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۖ هُمْ فِيهَا خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those who did well will have the best reward and more besides. Neither darkness nor shame will cover their faces: these are the companions in Paradise, and there they will remain.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ لِّلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"For those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"أَحْسَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"do good","transliteration":"aḥsanū","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","en_gloss":"(is) the best","transliteration":"l-ḥus'nā","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَزِيَادَةٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"and more","transliteration":"waziyādatun","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَرْهَقُ","en_gloss":"(will) cover","transliteration":"yarhaqu","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وُجُوهَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their faces","transliteration":"wujūhahum","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَتَرٌۭ","en_gloss":"dust","transliteration":"qatarun","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ذِلَّةٌ ۚ","en_gloss":"humiliation","transliteration":"dhillatun","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"Those","transliteration":"ulāika","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","en_gloss":"(are the) companions","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۖ","en_gloss":"(of) Paradise","transliteration":"l-janati","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":14,"ar":"هُمْ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"hum","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"10:26"},{"pos":16,"ar":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_gloss":"(will) abide fo